bio = "A tattooed camper who lives under a granite overhang up Tenaya Creek, above Mirror Lake. Invented for the game: a secret, not a historical figure."
idle_lines = PackedStringArray("Listen. The creek changes its mind about every ten minutes.", "Rangers walked right past the cairn last week. Didn't even look.", "Every tattoo's a place. This one's Tuolumne. This one's a bad night on the Nose.", "The ravens up here know my name. Well. They know a name.", "Bear box has peanut butter and tortillas if you're hungry. Don't open the coffee can.")
